  "summary": "ClickLock Stealer is a modular macOS infostealer delivered through ClickFix paste-into-Terminal lures that chains a Cloudflare-themed orchestrator, credential and Keychain stealers, a multi-chain crypto harvester and a GSocket reverse-shell backdoor, exfiltrating everything through Telegram bots and compromised WordPress domains. If the victim refuses the fake password dialog the malware locks the desktop by killing interactive processes at sub-second intervals until compliance, then timestomps and self-deletes while the gs-netcat backdoor persists.",
